Across 197 benchmark games in live **RIDER search mode**, checkpoint `2935113210` successfully flipped the asymmetric matchup against Nigo. Despite Nigo holding a major base physical damage advantage, Ichigo's tactical search tree cleared all three difficulty tiers.

